WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.240
I was President of the Usher Board at Mt. Zion [Baptist Church].

2
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:12.880
But I did not participate because we were working [at the Post Office] under what was called the Hatch Act,

3
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:18.470
which said that we could not deal in politics, or we could lose our jobs.

4
00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:25.960
Of course that didn’t stop me from making contributions financially to the cause.

5
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.040
That was the only way that I could support the boycott.
